{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46257","headline":"绣州张相公见访 · 贯休","name":"绣州张相公见访","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"德符唐德瑞通天，曾叱谗谀玉座前。\n千袭彩衣宫锦薄，数牀御札主恩偏。\n出师暂放张良箸，得罪惟撑范蠡船。\n未报君恩终必报，不妨金地礼青莲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46257.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46257","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}